title:
Species Status Assessment Report
for Eight Virginia Cave Beetles (Genus Pseudanophthalmus):
Little Kennedy cave beetle (P. cordicollis), Holsinger's cave beetle (P. holsingeri), Hubbard’s cave beetle (P. hubbardi), Hubricht’s cave beetle (P. hubrichti), Shenandoah cave beetle (P. limicola), Hupp’s Hill cave beetle (P. parvicollis), Overlooked cave beetle (P. praetermissus), and Silken cave beetle (P. sericus)

citation:
USFWS. 2023. Species Status Assessment Report
for Eight Virginia Cave Beetles (Genus Pseudanophthalmus):
Little Kennedy cave beetle (P. cordicollis), Holsinger's cave beetle (P. holsingeri), Hubbard’s cave beetle (P. hubbardi), Hubricht’s cave beetle (P. hubrichti), Shenandoah cave beetle (P. limicola), Hupp’s Hill cave beetle (P. parvicollis), Overlooked cave beetle (P. praetermissus), and Silken cave beetle (P. sericus). Species Status Assessment Reports. Hadley, MA
